ts=2026-06-23T21:03:30.000Z type=context scope=balloonwar content="Session clever-pixel: 8 user msgs, 20 assistant msgs, first topic: reamintesteti conversttia noastra de pe windows di urmatorul URL  https://opncd.ai/share/S26DhJfU"
